a boolean called affirmed is true.
a boolean called denied is false.
If affirmed or affirmed then, Print "or fired on true-true".
If affirmed or denied then, Print "or fired on true-false".
If denied or affirmed then, Print "or fired on false-true".
If denied or denied then, Print "or MISFIRED on false-false".
